inl executable_atlas () = Task ("EXECUTABLE-ATLAS", "A small redacted executable atlas from the espiral-comum repos (gh-pages: HPOW.md, EC2025*.md, KMLs, PDFs): source objects (exact bytes, revision), claims, checks (programs with declared parameters), results (with limitations), presentations (prose, map, notebook, translation); first checks: arithmetic claims (1943 = 29 x 67 is not prime), distance under declared models (sphere 6371 km vs WGS84 differ: ~816.92 vs ~817.68 km), KML metadata lint (dragon alpha24 file names itself alpha23), PDF signature verification as a separate layer (RFC 3161); keep private coordinates and identifiers out of any public demo", Feature, P3, D6, 0u32, Planned, "TEST-RUN-REPORT", "atlas,kino,tests", "current", "current")
