inl note_of_ml_labs_1 () = Note ("ML-LABS", 1u32, "2026-10-14T12:55Z", "lane-a", "08:55 lane-a: inventory of Spiral-s-ML-Library 80d6a1a (2026-02-05): 174 .spi/.spir; Leduc Lab = game/leduc (base, cardm, deckm, game, model_cfr, model_cem, play_*), 1,148 lines; Tensor Lab = corebase/tensorm + corecuda/tensor_cuda, 613 lines. Real parser per block in measure\\ml-parse.txt.")
