inl compiler_cli_default_numerics () = Task ("COMPILER-CLI-DEFAULT-NUMERICS", "--default-int/--default-float on the direct --backend path (Default_Int/Default_Float exist only in the server arguments, spiral_compiler.fs ~7222); mrakgr's ML library needs i32/f32 and the fork compiles it with f64 (skip if the compiler lane already tracks it); 17:40 compiler lane: takeDefaultTypeFlags strips --default-int/--default-float in any mode and sets SPIRAL_DEFAULT_INT/SPIRAL_DEFAULT_FLOAT, startupParse reads them before falling back to i32/f64, invalid value exits 2 with the allowed list; verified on both cores (--default-int i64 --default-float f32 -> float32 = 1.5f, int64 = 3L); single-flight frontier+smoke run single-flight-20261012-173617 matches the ladder on 169/169 rows; in commit 2ef85029 except the Program.fs usage-string spacing fix (uncommitted)", TaskKind, P2, D2, 100u32, Done, "", "compiler,ml", "current", "current")
