inl kino_prefix_module_unbound () = Task ("KINO-PREFIX-MODULE-UNBOUND", "Kino: in a ///- --package . notebook, a package module whose name is a prefix of the notebook file stem is unbound in test programs (apps/tibia/pack_sim.spi with module pack, listed last: open pack -> ETY-UnboundModule; renamed hunting_pack passes); ruled out by the tibia lane: daemon cache, mounts, the compiler (hand-built cell package resolves open pack), core/testing bindings; likely a starts_with on the notebook stem in test-plan or module selection; filed 2026-10-13 09:37 from the tibia lane (workaround: hunting_pack); 2026-10-13 09:55 Kino lane: not reproducible on current Kino (3 real runs pass: minimal pack + pack_sim fixture; module added to the project after a first run; a copy of apps/tibia with hunting_pack renamed back to pack, listed last, golden_seed_7_troll_pack on c passes with open pack); no starts_with on the notebook stem exists in Kino's plan, mounts or memo; a fake-compile regression test (module named like a prefix of the stem stays opened in the test program) is in notebook_report_test.exs; needs the exact failing command/state from the tibia lane (likely the pre-08:30 Kino, a second ///- line, or a stale mount)", Story, P3, D3, 100u32, Done, "", "kino,modules", "current", "current")
