inl note_of_spiral_formatter_5 () = Note ("SPIRAL-FORMATTER", 5u32, "2026-10-14T11:29Z", "user", "2026-10-14 07:29 user decision for today's lane: develop the formatter without compiler rebuilds, either as an .fsx over the compiled SpiralCompilerCore.dll (real tokenizer/block parser) or by writing it in Spiral and compiling it to .fsx, whichever workflow produces code like apps/tibia and not like eoie; in the F# target, simulate GADTs, existentials and HKTs with phantom data as much as possible; reread the five mega samples for the techniques first")
