inl note_of_spiral_formatter_47 () = Note ("SPIRAL-FORMATTER", 47u32, "2026-10-15T11:36Z", "lane-a", "07:36 lane-a: root cause of the 06:05 G3 miss found: Parsed.fsx shapeOf printed KeyValuePair as an unknown marker, and the parser keeps union cases and type records in F# Maps, so every union body and type record was skipped by the parse guard. Fixed (key and value compared); the failing mega union block now compares different (exists applied to args: packed continuation at its own application column). Type layout rules re-added behind the fixed guard; 3-sample check (contract_higher_rank_hot_swap, contract_cross_backend_probe, array_heap_heap_pair): layout over-120 271 to 0, parse 3/3, G1, G7.2, 0 guard blocks; G3 and mega runs queued.")
