inl note_of_eoie_agile_todos_3 () = Note ("EOIE-AGILE-TODOS", 3u32, "2026-10-16T06:43Z", "main-thread", "02:43 main: command_spec_domain is at 998/1000 gate lines after agile todos. Splitting agile_subcommand (union, names, from_index, known) into its own crate needs eoie_cli_routing/routing_terminal.spi's rust_global use-list edited, and a touched rust_global must be migrated (eoie-granular-spiral), so the split is its own task: route agile subcommand validation through a typed crate instead of the use-list. Not started; the next verb must do it first.")
